title: "RiceKG: Knowledge Graph and Semantic Web Rule Language-Based Expert System for Rice Pest and Disease Diagnosis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Furqon
    given-names: Ariful
    affiliation: "Department of Information Technology, Faculty of Computer Science, Universitas Jember"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ariful-Furqon/RiceKG-Expert-System"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - knowledge-graph
