  - swrl-rules
  - expert-system
  - rice-pest-disease
  - pellet-reasoner
  - smart-agriculture
  - explainable-ai
abstract: >-
  An explainable semantic knowledge graph and multi-tier SWRL reasoning
  system for rice biotic stressor diagnosis and prescriptive integrated
  pest management (IPM). The framework formalizes 10 major biotic threats
  (5 pests and 5 diseases), 45 phenotypic symptoms, and 20 SWRL inference
  rules using OWL 2 Description Logic with the Pellet DL reasoner.
